Add Node Exporter to Prometheus

Open:

Shell
nano prometheus.yml

Add:

YAML
global:
  scrape_interval: 15s

scrape_configs:
  - job_name: "prometheus"
    static_configs:
      - targets:
          - "localhost:9090"

  - job_name: "node-exporter"
    static_configs:
      - targets:
          - "172.17.0.1:9100"




